/SBC{ FC moveto SW -2 div 0 rmoveto show } BD
/SBR{ FC moveto SW neg 0 rmoveto show } BD
/SCL{ FC moveto 0 SH -2 div rmoveto show } BD
/SCC{ FC moveto SW -2 div SH -2 div rmoveto show } BD
